  Every row carries `source = openstreetmap`, `license = ODbL-1.0` and an
  `osm_url` that points at the element it was read from, so any single fact in
  this corpus can be checked against — and corrected in — the upstream map.

  ODbL is share-alike: a Produced Work made from these rows must credit
  OpenStreetMap, and a publicly distributed *derived database* must be offered
  under ODbL. That obligation travels with the R2 Data Catalog tables
  (`cloud_itonami.eigyo_lead` and siblings) if they are ever shared outside
  this account, not only with the files in this repository.

  Contact values (email addresses, telephone numbers) present in OpenStreetMap
  are NOT copied into this corpus. See `src/eigyo_list/lead.cljc`.
